                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b531b1f3-f0c5-45c9-aa24-37f688448165",
                        "source_entry_id": "f05f971c-1736-35e1-909d-a87f7968ecda",
                        "source_sense_id": "24034320-7108-3ae8-89f6-cda4c141f6d6",
                        "target_lang_word": "insufficiency",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "insufficiency",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c616240-77f7-3b83-99f3-00a39097915f",
                                        "entry_id": "7a4893fa-4443-338a-85de-fbc7d4e3be6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lack of sufficiency; a shortage or inadequacy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96aa6839-3f6f-449f-83ea-a2e42787de4d",
                                                "sense_id": "5c616240-77f7-3b83-99f3-00a39097915f",
                                                "text": "The troops went hungry because of the insufficiency of their supplies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ea9b8fd-cb2e-4621-a967-9edfdd25dea5",
                                                "sense_id": "5c616240-77f7-3b83-99f3-00a39097915f",
                                                "text": "She may crowd her days with gaiety, variety, and what are called amusements; she will do so only to find their insufficiency."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2706f065-c71b-43ba-8533-a2e00737f52f",
                                                "sense_id": "5c616240-77f7-3b83-99f3-00a39097915f",
                                                "text": "On a recent trip down the Rhine many of the trains we saw were still steam-hauled, presumably through an insufficiency of electric locomotives, as yet, to deal with peak summer traffic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1d4668c-84d8-47e3-82a7-ed31e25e11a7",
                        "source_entry_id": "f05f971c-1736-35e1-909d-a87f7968ecda",
                        "source_sense_id": "24034320-7108-3ae8-89f6-cda4c141f6d6",
                        "target_lang_word": "failure",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "failure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7629cfe-1cfb-3559-9594-d8294d2d9bec",
                                        "entry_id": "55dc3aa4-b161-396b-9901-3af6b6a43fb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "State or condition of not meeting a desirable or intended objective, opposite of success."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "418522ba-9c0f-49c2-95fe-0534be243483",
                                                "sense_id": "a7629cfe-1cfb-3559-9594-d8294d2d9bec",
                                                "text": "For Liverpool, their season will now be regarded as a relative disappointment after failure to add the FA Cup to the Carling Cup and not mounting a challenge to reach the Champions League places."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8855f191-2ece-4770-8777-2d17358b84b9",
                                                "sense_id": "a7629cfe-1cfb-3559-9594-d8294d2d9bec",
                                                "text": "Sarkozy's total will be seen as a personal failure. It is the first time an outgoing president has failed to win a first-round vote in the past 50 years and makes it harder for Sarkozy to regain momentum."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "738572ff-961d-42b3-b703-678254b027ac",
                                                "sense_id": "a7629cfe-1cfb-3559-9594-d8294d2d9bec",
                                                "text": "What exactly is a \"successful failure\" in rocket science? A so-called \"successful failure\" is one where important lessons can be gleaned for future tests and where the risks of harm are low, experts say."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49070ad2-0599-3b05-b8fe-ca964a9bbf3a",
                                        "entry_id": "55dc3aa4-b161-396b-9901-3af6b6a43fb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "State or condition of not meeting a desirable or intended objective, opposite of success.",
                                            "A condition in which a specified organ does not function well enough to support life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70099a53-13ef-4b2f-8638-2e164f336314",
                                                "sense_id": "49070ad2-0599-3b05-b8fe-ca964a9bbf3a",
                                                "text": "heart failure"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbe55320-7acf-4cf7-92ff-689d871dfe49",
                                                "sense_id": "49070ad2-0599-3b05-b8fe-ca964a9bbf3a",
                                                "text": "congestive heart failure"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44ecba1a-8e66-43ad-a70a-c616ec0a61ae",
                                                "sense_id": "49070ad2-0599-3b05-b8fe-ca964a9bbf3a",
                                                "text": "liver failure"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baaea44a-5281-43c2-b241-9dad13f2b08d",
                                                "sense_id": "49070ad2-0599-3b05-b8fe-ca964a9bbf3a",
                                                "text": "kidney failure"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ccd806ed-855f-354d-a89c-c30acb1d2c67",
                                        "entry_id": "55dc3aa4-b161-396b-9901-3af6b6a43fb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Omission to do something, whether or not it was attempted, especially something that ought to have been done."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5816cc6e-7eb4-3740-8f73-050f812c789e",
                                        "entry_id": "55dc3aa4-b161-396b-9901-3af6b6a43fb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An object, person or endeavour in a state of failure, has failed at something or incapable of success."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d0a0533-2b6a-3108-b571-cca7c9cc369e",
                                        "entry_id": "55dc3aa4-b161-396b-9901-3af6b6a43fb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Termination of the ability of an item to perform its required function; breakdown."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a17be102-0e0b-45fd-830a-591d925e27e8",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0a0533-2b6a-3108-b571-cca7c9cc369e",
                                                "text": "Seeing the British establishment struggle with the financial sector is like watching an alcoholic […]. Until 2008 there was denial over what finance had become. When a series of bank failures made this impossible, there was widespread anger, leading to the public humiliation of symbolic figures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de06f8b5-593d-4d74-9367-5fd1893e91ed",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0a0533-2b6a-3108-b571-cca7c9cc369e",
                                                "text": "But as with individual train failures you have to tackle every one as it arises and assume it will happen again, which it will, if you don't do something about it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85a6d2b5-d68b-3cc4-8678-43be2f65ef6f",
                                        "entry_id": "55dc3aa4-b161-396b-9901-3af6b6a43fb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bankruptcy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6b3d9788-ccd6-4c46-b4bd-4e15345af5b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "f05f971c-1736-35e1-909d-a87f7968ecda",
                        "source_sense_id": "24034320-7108-3ae8-89f6-cda4c141f6d6",
                        "target_lang_word": "недостаточность",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "недостаточность",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a9c4470-2f19-393f-9e96-a6315d28e6f6",
                                        "entry_id": "240fab94-e0c8-3936-904b-0352b1309de7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "свойство по значению прилагательного недостаточный"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cf7fe3f-9c5b-4ffe-a75b-93310d164135",
                                                "sense_id": "2a9c4470-2f19-393f-9e96-a6315d28e6f6",
                                                "text": "В случае недостаточности исходной информации карты дополняются результатами необходимых полевых исследований."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ee7ac37-f89b-456a-9037-ffe7a5b31712",
                                                "sense_id": "2a9c4470-2f19-393f-9e96-a6315d28e6f6",
                                                "text": "За недостаточностью улик следствие по её делу прекратили, но возвращаться домой она не захотела, несмотря на мольбы своих родителей, и осталась в тюрьме, на чёрной работе."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4793a7c1-6596-424e-819c-f01570bca401",
                                                "sense_id": "2a9c4470-2f19-393f-9e96-a6315d28e6f6",
                                                "text": "Недостаточность материальных средств и опыта не позволила нам сделать необходимую для большого европейского города рекламу."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5eb487b-1f11-30bb-b8ee-016a3d351cf0",
                                        "entry_id": "240fab94-e0c8-3936-904b-0352b1309de7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "мед. недостаточная, не соответствующая физиологическим потребностям функция какого-либо органа или ткани"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9eabb204-3145-40de-940b-a65756925994",
                                                "sense_id": "c5eb487b-1f11-30bb-b8ee-016a3d351cf0",
                                                "text": "Уникальный безрецептурный препарат на основе экстракта красных листьев винограда с доказанной эффективностью лечит симптомы хронической венозной недостаточности и предупреждает их развитие."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9d0e9ae-055a-4046-b759-560450b47645",
                                                "sense_id": "c5eb487b-1f11-30bb-b8ee-016a3d351cf0",
                                                "text": "В два года у него нашли хроническую почечную недостаточность."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5a0a194-2ccd-436b-93d7-709ff98414da",
                                                "sense_id": "c5eb487b-1f11-30bb-b8ee-016a3d351cf0",
                                                "text": "Во всяком случае, падение содержания кальция в крови - симптом, патогномонический для функциональной недостаточности эпителиальных телец."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c7f7154-bcaf-3087-a7b1-135d5abe0298",
                                        "entry_id": "240fab94-e0c8-3936-904b-0352b1309de7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "мед. недостаточная, не соответствующая физиологическим потребностям функция какого-либо органа или ткани",
                                            "мед. нехватка или отсутствие должного количества чего-либо, необходимого для нормальной жизнедеятельности организма"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70fdc0ea-08ae-4bf8-b766-4fdf39c3fed9",
                                                "sense_id": "2c7f7154-bcaf-3087-a7b1-135d5abe0298",
                                                "text": "Во всяком случае, падение содержания кальция в крови - симптом, патогномонический для функциональной недостаточности эпителиальных телец."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3590f8fe-acdc-419f-80b6-c9d31a82b5f0",
                                                "sense_id": "2c7f7154-bcaf-3087-a7b1-135d5abe0298",
                                                "text": "Уникальный безрецептурный препарат на основе экстракта красных листьев винограда с доказанной эффективностью лечит симптомы хронической венозной недостаточности и предупреждает их развитие."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7477da2-e91e-45a0-8684-dbc20ef77cea",
                                                "sense_id": "2c7f7154-bcaf-3087-a7b1-135d5abe0298",
                                                "text": "В два года у него нашли хроническую почечную недостаточность."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fc49741-d824-4311-be48-82d85f03e88c",
                                                "sense_id": "2c7f7154-bcaf-3087-a7b1-135d5abe0298",
                                                "text": "Недостаточность витамина встречается редко, поскольку он синтезируется микробами в кишечнике."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b189685a-c8e6-4035-81a0-6d06e5f237b2",
                                                "sense_id": "2c7f7154-bcaf-3087-a7b1-135d5abe0298",
                                                "text": "Люди, постоянно живущие в горных районах, кислородной недостаточностью не страдают."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4cfe2e3c-386f-40b5-ac3c-c4488a7b37ba",
